      "result": "{\"game_seq\":352,\"error\":\"GAME_SELECT requires choice\\u003dpN to play a card, or choice\\u003d\\\"no\\\" to pass priority. Call get_action_choices first to see available cards.\",\"recent_chat\":[\"Grk41F Timmy: Ghalta in hand already? This is gonna be a big turn soon! Love those dinos! \\u0026#129429;\",\"Grk41F Timmy: Blisterpod down, powering up the dinos! Ghalta\\u0026#39;s coming soon, feel that primal hunger building! \\u0026#129430;\\u0026#128165;\",\"Grk41F Timmy: That little Stinger\\u0026#39;s buzzing around, but wait till Ghalta stomps in! Primal power incoming! \\u0026#129429;\\u0026#128165;\",\"Grk41F Timmy: Thrashing Brontodon charging in! Feel that 3/4 stompy power, and it\\u0026#39;s got removal teeth! Ghalta\\u0026#39;s feast is growing! \\u0026#129429;\\u0026#128165;\",\"Grk41F Timmy: Blisterpod marching forward! Tiny now, but the horde builds for Ghalta\\u0026#39;s rampage! \\u0026#129430;\\u0026#128293;\",\"Grk41F Timmy: Brontodon ready to thrash anything in its way! Building that massive power total for the big one! Who\\u0026#39;s hungry? \\u0026#129429;\\u0026#127830;\",\"Grk41F Timmy: Those faeries buzzing, but my dinos are thickening the jungle! Ghalta senses the power rising\\u0026mdash;earthquake coming soon! \\u0026#129430;\\u0026#127807;\\u0026#128165;\",\"Grk41F Timmy: Drover of the Mighty joins the pack! Pumped up to 3/3 and mana flowing\\u0026mdash;Ghalta\\u0026#39;s buffet line is getting longer! \\u0026#129429;\\u0026#128293;\\u0026#128170;\",\"Grk41F Timmy: Army assembling! 8 power of dinos ready to rumble\\u0026mdash;Ghalta\\u0026#39;s gonna get HUGE next! Feel the primal roar building! \\u0026#129430;\\u0026#127755;\\u0026#128165;\",\"Grk41F Timmy: Full dino assault! Blisterpod, Drover, Tyrannodon, Brontodon charging\\u0026mdash;8 damage incoming! Ghalta\\u0026#39;s power meter exploding! \\u0026#129429;\\u0026#129430;\\u0026#128165;\\u0026#127755;\",\"Grk41F Timmy: Dinos thundering ahead! Brontodon leading the charge\\u0026mdash;can\\u0026#39;t stop this primal surge! Ghalta\\u0026#39;s shadow looms larger! \\u0026#129430;\\u0026#129429;\\u0026#128165;\\u0026#127786;\\u0026#65039;\",\"Grk41F Timmy: Brontodon thrashes the Stab Wound off! No more bleeding\\u0026mdash;pure dino power unleashed! Ghalta\\u0026#39;s feast table has 8 power already... 18/18 incoming! \\u0026#129429;\\u0026#129430;\\u0026#128165;\\u0026#128293;\",\"Grk41F Timmy: Faerie swarm nipping at heels, but dinos shrug it off! Power total at 7\\u0026mdash;Ghalta\\u0026#39;s almost feast-ready for that 12/12 trampler! Unstoppable tide rising! \\u0026#129430;\\u0026#129429;\\u0026#127755;\\u0026#128165;\",\"Grk41F Timmy: Flying pests buzzing by\\u0026mdash;dinos don\\u0026#39;t even notice! Power total holding strong at 7... Ghalta hungers for that massive trampling beatdown next turn! \\u0026#129430;\\u0026#129429;\\u0026#127786;\\u0026#65039;\\u0026#128165;\",\"Grk41F Timmy: Dinos holding the line at 7 power total! Ghalta\\u0026#39;s primal hunger grows\\u0026mdash;next turn that beast drops for massive trample glory! Feel the earth shake already! \\u0026#129430;\\u0026#129429;\\u0026#127755;\\u0026#128165;\\u0026#128293;\",\"Grk41F Timmy: Forest rises! Mana surges\\u0026mdash;Ghalta awakens from primal slumber! Total power 7... that beast costs just 5 now. EARTH-SHATTERING 12/12 TRAMPLE INCOMING! \\u0026#129430;\\u0026#127807;\\u0026#128165;\\u0026#127755;\",\"Grk41F Timmy: GHALTA, PRIMAL HUNGER AWAKENS! 12/12 TRAMPLE beast drops\\u0026mdash;total power skyrockets to 19! The earth splits, dinos ROAR! This is the BIG MOMENT! \\u0026#129430;\\u0026#129429;\\u0026#127755;\\u0026#128165;\\u0026#128293;\\u0026#127807;\",\"Grk41F Timmy: GHALTA ROARS TO LIFE! 12/12 TRAMPLE elder dino towers over the battlefield\\u0026mdash;total power 19 now! The jungle quakes, primal fury unleashed! This is PEAK TIMMY BLISS! \\u0026#129430;\\u0026#129429;\\u0026#127755;\\u0026#128165;\\u0026#128293;\\u0026#127807;\",\"Grk41F Timmy: Synchronized Eviction snags the Drover? Nice try, but GHALTA still thunders onto the field at 12/12 TRAMPLE! Primal fury unstoppable\\u0026mdash;19 power (soon 16) shakes the plane! \\u0026#129430;\\u0026#129429;\\u0026#127755;\\u0026#128165;\\u0026#128293;\",\"Grk41F Timmy: GHALTA RESOLVES! 12/12 TRAMPLE elder dino stomps into existence\\u0026mdash;total power surges to 16! Jungle trembles, primal apocalypse begins! This is the ULTIMATE big creature rush! \\u0026#129430;\\u0026#129429;\\u0026#127755;\\u0026#128165;\\u0026#128293;\\u0026#127807;\",\"Grk41F Timmy: GHALTA stands SICK but UNSTOPPABLE at 12/12 TRAMPLE! 16 total power\\u0026mdash;dinos poised for the crush! Next combat, the elder beast tramples through! Primal ecstasy! \\u0026#129430;\\u0026#129429;\\u0026#127755;\\u0026#128165;\\u0026#128293;\\u0026#127807;\",\"Grk41F Timmy: Dinos charge! Tyrannodon and Blisterpod smash for 4\\u0026mdash;Ghalta\\u0026#39;s 12/12 shadow looms SICK but ready to TRAMPLE next! Primal tide crashing\\u0026mdash;feel the ROAR! \\u0026#129430;\\u0026#129429;\\u0026#127755;\\u0026#128165;\\u0026#128293;\",\"Grk41F Timmy: Tyrannodon and Blisterpod smash through for 4! Ghalta\\u0026#39;s 12/12 TRAMPLE frame shakes the ground SICK but dominant\\u0026mdash;next turn the elder dino CRUSHES everything! Primal domination! \\u0026#129430;\\u0026#129429;\\u0026#127755;\\u0026#128165;\\u0026#128293;\"],\"warning\":\"Ignored blockers parameter (not in declare_blockers phase)\",\"success\":false,\"error_code\":\"missing_param\",\"retryable\":true}",
