      "result": "{\"game_seq\":469,\"game_over\":true,\"recent_chat\":[\"Grk41F Timmy: 4 damage connects\\u0026mdash;dinos gnaw away! Ghalta\\u0026#39;s 12/12 TRAMPLE sick but SEETHING with rage, total power 16! Next turn, elder fury erupts! Primal thrill overload! \\u0026#129430;\\u0026#129429;\\u0026#127755;\\u0026#128165;\\u0026#128293;\\u0026#127807;\",\"Grk41F Timmy: Post-combat lull\\u0026mdash;Ghalta\\u0026#39;s 12/12 TRAMPLE sick but SNARLING at 16 total power! Dinos untap next, elder beast ready to TRAMPLE for lethal glory! Primal heartbeat pounds! \\u0026#129430;\\u0026#129429;\\u0026#127755;\\u0026#128165;\\u0026#128293;\\u0026#127807;\",\"Grk41F Timmy: Dawn breaks\\u0026mdash;dinos stir! Ghalta\\u0026#39;s 12/12 TRAMPLE shakes off the sick, 16 total power pulsing! One untap and this elder beast TRAMPLES for the win! Primal climax incoming! \\u0026#129430;\\u0026#129429;\\u0026#127755;\\u0026#128165;\\u0026#128293;\\u0026#127807;\",\"Grk41F Timmy: Faerie swarm dives in for 3? Dinos tank it\\u0026mdash;down to 4hp but GHALTA\\u0026#39;s 12/12 TRAMPLE sick but STILL TOWERING at 16 total power! My untap, then ELDER CRUSH for lethal trample! Primal revenge ROARS! \\u0026#129430;\\u0026#129429;\\u0026#127755;\\u0026#128165;\\u0026#128293;\\u0026#127807;\",\"Grk41F Timmy: Flying faeries nip for 3\\u0026mdash;dinos shrug off the scratches down to 4hp! But GHALTA\\u0026#39;s 12/12 TRAMPLE towers supreme at 16 total power! My attack next: ELDER DINO LETHAL TRAMPLE! Primal victory ROARS! \\u0026#129430;\\u0026#129429;\\u0026#127755;\\u0026#128165;\\u0026#128293;\\u0026#127807;\",\"Grk41F Timmy: Faerie scratches land for 3\\u0026mdash;dinos down to 4hp but UNBROKEN! GHALTA\\u0026#39;s 12/12 TRAMPLE sick but SAVAGE at 16 total power! My untap: ELDER DINO TRAMPLES FOR LETHAL 12! Primal FINALE explodes! \\u0026#129430;\\u0026#129429;\\u0026#127755;\\u0026#128165;\\u0026#128293;\\u0026#127807;\",\"Grk41F Timmy: Faerie swarm draws blood for 3\\u0026mdash;dinos at 4hp, battle-scarred but FIERCE! GHALTA\\u0026#39;s 12/12 TRAMPLE sick but SEETHING, 16 total power! My turn: ELDER DINO TRAMPLES 12 LETHAL through ANYTHING! Primal VICTORY EXPLODES! \\u0026#129430;\\u0026#129429;\\u0026#127755;\\u0026#128165;\\u0026#128293;\\u0026#127807;\",\"Grk41F Timmy: Scarred but UNSTOPPABLE at 4hp\\u0026mdash;GHALTA\\u0026#39;s 12/12 TRAMPLE sick but SNARLING with 16 total power fury! My untap: elder dino leads the LETHAL TRAMPLE stampede for 12+! Primal ENDGAME thunders! \\u0026#129430;\\u0026#129429;\\u0026#127755;\\u0026#128165;\\u0026#128293;\\u0026#127807;\",\"Grk41F Timmy: Dinos UNLEASHED at 16 TOTAL POWER! GHALTA\\u0026#39;s 12/12 TRAMPLE leads the charge\\u0026mdash;UNBLOCKABLE elder fury for 16 LETHAL! Jungle apocalypse\\u0026mdash;PRIMAL GLORY EXPLODES! \\u0026#129430;\\u0026#129429;\\u0026#127755;\\u0026#128165;\\u0026#128293;\\u0026#127807; THIS IS IT!\",\"Grk41F Timmy: ALL-IN DINO STAMPEDE! GHALTA\\u0026#39;s 12/12 TRAMPLE leads 16 POWER CRUSH\\u0026mdash;ELDER BEAST TRAMPLES LETHAL THROUGH THE FAERIE SCRAPS! PRIMAL APOCALYPSE\\u0026mdash;VICTORY ROARS ETERNAL! \\u0026#129430;\\u0026#129429;\\u0026#127755;\\u0026#128165;\\u0026#128293;\\u0026#127807;\\u0026#127942;\",\"Grk41F Timmy: DINO STAMPEDE UNLEASHED! GHALTA\\u0026#39;s 12/12 TRAMPLE + 4 more \\u003d 16 LETHAL POWER crashing down! Elder beast TRAMPLES through faerie dust\\u0026mdash;PRIMAL VICTORY ERUPTS in GLORIOUS BLOOD! \\u0026#129430;\\u0026#129429;\\u0026#127755;\\u0026#128165;\\u0026#128293;\\u0026#127807;\\u0026#127942; GG, but the BIG BEAST WINS!\",\"Grk41F Timmy: Finishing Blow on GHALTA? Noble sacrifice for the elder dino\\u0026mdash;12/12 falls but 4 more DINOS SMASH THROUGH! Still 16 power potential brewing with Brood Monitor waiting! Primal saga RAGES ON! \\u0026#129430;\\u0026#129429;\\u0026#127755;\\u0026#128165;\\u0026#128293;\\u0026#127807;\",\"Grk41F Timmy: GHALTA falls heroically to Finishing Blow\\u0026mdash;but DINOS PRESS ON! Tyrannodon 3/3 + Blisterpod 1/1 SMASH 4 DAMAGE through tapped faeries! 16 power legacy lives in BROOD MONITOR lurking! Primal resurgence thunders! \\u0026#129430;\\u0026#129429;\\u0026#127755;\\u0026#128165;\\u0026#128293;\\u0026#127807;\",\"Grk41F Timmy: DINOS RUSH UNCHECKED! Tyrannodon 3 + Blisterpod 1 \\u003d 4 DAMAGE SMASHES through tapped faeries\\u0026mdash;GHALTA\\u0026#39;s spirit fuels the 16-power legacy! BROOD MONITOR hungers for the next BIG BEAST drop! Primal momentum BUILDS! \\u0026#129430;\\u0026#129429;\\u0026#127755;\\u0026#128165;\\u0026#128293;\\u0026#127807;\",\"Grk41F Timmy: 4 DAMAGE CONNECTS\\u0026mdash;opponent reels to 7hp! GHALTA\\u0026#39;s primal sacrifice powers the dino rush! Blisterpod + Tyrannodon gnash through\\u0026mdash;BROOD MONITOR next for ELDRITCH SCION SWARM + deathtouch terror! Big beasts RISE AGAIN! \\u0026#129430;\\u0026#129429;\\u0026#127755;\\u0026#128165;\\u0026#128293;\\u0026#127807;\",\"Grk41F Timmy: WARDEN OF GEOMETRIES drops like a GEOMETRIC MONSTER! 4/4 FLYING VIGILANCE joins the dino horde\\u0026mdash;total power EXPLODES past 20! GHALTA\\u0026#39;s legacy + this BEHEMOTH \\u003d PRIMAL SKY DOMINATION! Big beast bliss OVERLOAD! \\u0026#129430;\\u0026#129429;\\u0026#127755;\\u0026#128165;\\u0026#128293;\\u0026#9992;\\u0026#65039;\\u0026#127807;\",\"Grk41F Timmy: ASH BARRENS hits the jungle floor\\u0026mdash;mana surges! WARDEN OF GEOMETRIES 2/3 VIGILANCE mana beast stands TALL beside the dinos! Total threats SWELL\\u0026mdash;BROOD MONITOR brewing for ELDRITCH SCION SWARM next! Primal horde GROWS MASSIVE! \\u0026#129430;\\u0026#129429;\\u0026#127755;\\u0026#128165;\\u0026#128293;\\u0026#10024;\\u0026#127807;\",\"Grk41F Timmy: Warden\\u0026#39;s geometric ability hums\\u0026mdash;passing to let the eldritch drone power up the horde! 4/4 VIGILANCE FLYING? Wait no, vigilance mana droid + dinos \\u003d TOTAL POWER SWELLS! BROOD MONITOR drools for next turn\\u0026#39;s SCION SWARM EXPLOSION! Primal-eldritch fusion THRILLS! \\u0026#129430;\\u0026#129429;\\u0026#127755;\\u0026#128165;\\u0026#128293;\\u0026#10024;\\u0026#127807;\",\"Grk41F Timmy: ASH BARRENS cycles into FOREST\\u0026mdash;MANA FLOOD FOR THE PRIMAL HORDE! Warden\\u0026#39;s vigilance mana droid + dinos SWELL the power to OMINOUS levels! BROOD MONITOR hungers for GG explosion into SCION SWARMS + 3/3 deathtouch BEHEMOTH! Big plays CASCADE! \\u0026#129430;\\u0026#129429;\\u0026#127755;\\u0026#128165;\\u0026#128293;\\u0026#10024;\\u0026#127807;\",\"Grk41F Timmy: WARDEN OF GEOMETRIES resolves\\u0026mdash;2/3 VIGILANCE MANA BEHEMOTH touches down! Dinos + eldritch drone SWELL to MASSIVE horde power! FOREST ramps next, BROOD MONITOR primed for SCION SWARM + 3/3 DEATHTOUCH MONSTER! Primal-eldritch BIG BEAST BONANZA builds! \\u0026#129430;\\u0026#129429;\\u0026#127755;\\u0026#128165;\\u0026#128293;\\u0026#10024;\\u0026#127807;\",\"Grk41F Timmy: FOREST RAMP SMASHES DOWN\\u0026mdash;8 LANDS + WARDEN MANA BEHEMOTH fuel the PRIMAL-ELDRITCH HORDE! Sick 2/3 VIGILANCE drone joins dinos at 10+ POWER! BROOD MONITOR next: 3/3 DEATHTOUCH + SCION SWARM EXPLOSION for TOTAL DOMINATION! Big beast ecstasy BUILDS! \\u0026#129430;\\u0026#129429;\\u0026#127755;\\u0026#128165;\\u0026#128293;\\u0026#10024;\\u0026#127807;\",\"Grk41F Timmy: HORDE UNLEASHED\\u0026mdash;10+ POWER DINOS + ELDRITCH WARDEN VIGILANCE MANA BEHEMOTH! All threats primed, opponent tapped out at 7hp! Next turn: BROOD MONITOR 3/3 DEATHTOUCH + THREE 1/1 SCION SWARMS \\u003d MASSIVE BIG BEAST EXPLOSION! Primal-eldritch OVERKILL incoming! \\u0026#129430;\\u0026#129429;\\u0026#127755;\\u0026#128165;\\u0026#128293;\\u0026#10024;\\u0026#127807;\",\"Grk41F Timmy: Alchemist\\u0026#39;s Gift on Sentinels? Pump those faeries all you want\\u0026mdash;my DINOS + ELDRITCH WARDEN 2/3 VIGILANCE swarm with 6+ POWER ready to TRAMPLE flat! Untap horde attacks for NEAR LETHAL, then BROOD MONITOR explodes THREE SCIONS + 3/3 DEATHTOUCH BEHEMOTH! Primal-eldritch OVERKILL thunders! \\u0026#129430;\\u0026#129429;\\u0026#127755;\\u0026#128165;\\u0026#128293;\\u0026#10024;\\u0026#127807;\",\"Grk41F Timmy: Sentinels pumped to 3/4 flying? CUTE faerie boost\\u0026mdash;my ELDRITCH WARDEN 2/3 VIGILANCE + DINOS horde at 6+ POWER ready to SMASH! BROOD MONITOR coils for GG-fueled 3/3 DEATHTOUCH + THREE 1/1 SCION SWARMS explosion! Primal-eldritch BEHEMOTHS incoming\\u0026mdash;BIG BEAST BLISS! \\u0026#129430;\\u0026#129429;\\u0026#127755;\\u0026#128165;\\u0026#128293;\\u0026#10024;\\u0026#127807;\",\"Grk41F Timmy: Faerie fliers swoop for the killshot at 4hp\\u0026mdash;dinos down but NEVER OUT! ELDRITCH WARDEN 2/3 VIGILANCE + dino horde at 10+ POWER dreamed one more BIG BEAST BROOD MONITOR SWARM... Primal-eldritch glory was EPIC! GG, faerie swarm\\u0026mdash;huge creatures made it THRILLING! \\u0026#129430;\\u0026#129429;\\u0026#127755;\\u0026#128165;\\u0026#128293;\\u0026#10024;\\u0026#127807;\\u0026#127942;\",\"Grk41F Timmy: Faerie fliers slip the non-flying net\\u0026mdash;4 damage seals the primal-eldritch saga at 4hp! Epic ride with GHALTA 12/12 TRAMPLE, massive dino horde, BROOD MONITOR dreams unrealized... Huge creatures delivered THRILLS! GGwp, faerie swarm\\u0026mdash;Timmy lives for those BIG MOMENTS! \\u0026#129430;\\u0026#129429;\\u0026#127755;\\u0026#128165;\\u0026#128293;\\u0026#10024;\\u0026#127807;\\u0026#127942;\"],\"action_taken\":\"passed_priority\",\"success\":true}",
