      "description": "Cast Alchemist's Gift during opponent's combat with no way to meaningfully use it. Nightshade Stinger is tapped and can't block, so giving it +1/+1 and lifelink/deathtouch does nothing. Taking 1 damage from Blisterpod at 20 life is irrelevant. This wastes a useful combat trick that could later save a creature or enable a favorable trade.",
