      "description": "Timmy declined to activate Thrashing Brontodon to destroy Stab Wound on Drowsing Tyrannodon. Stab Wound is draining 2 life per turn (Timmy is at 13) and reducing Tyrannodon from 3/3 to 1/1. The Brontodon is summoning sick and can't block or attack this turn anyway, and Timmy has exactly 1 untapped Forest to pay the activation cost. Removing Stab Wound stops the life drain and restores the Tyrannodon to a useful 3/3.",
