    {
      "severity": "moderate",
      "description": "Declined to sacrifice Thrashing Brontodon to destroy Stab Wound on Drowsing Tyrannodon. Stab Wound is draining 2 life per upkeep (player at 12 life) AND reducing Tyrannodon from 3/3 to 1/1. The Brontodon is summoning sick so it can't block anyway. Keeping Brontodon for Ghalta cost reduction (3 power) is far less valuable than stopping the recurring 2-life drain and restoring the Tyrannodon.",
