    },
    {
      "severity": "moderate",
      "description": "Stab Wound is on Drowsing Tyrannodon (reducing it to 1/1 and draining 2 life per upkeep). At 12 life with Nightshade Stinger also attacking, the life drain is very threatening. Thrashing Brontodon can destroy the Stab Wound for just {1} and a sacrifice, restoring Tyrannodon to 3/3 and stopping the bleed. The Brontodon is summoning sick so no combat value is lost this turn.",
