      "decision_index": 205,
    },
    {
      "severity": "moderate",
      "description": "Player timed out or passed on choosing an ability for Alchemist's Gift while set up for lethal. With Sentinels of Glen Elendra becoming 3/4 flying plus Nightshade Stinger 1/1 flying, that's exactly 4 damage in the air against an opponent at 4 life with no flying blockers. Failing to make this choice risks the spell not resolving properly.",
